O            0.7451068700       0.3748717400       0.6028804000
O            0.7451068700       0.6251282600       0.1028804000
O            0.2548931300       0.6251282600       0.3971196000
O            0.2129623200       0.8950090400       0.9393489100
O            0.7870376800       0.8950090400       0.5606510900
O            0.7870376800       0.1049909600       0.0606510900
O            0.2129623200       0.1049909600       0.4393489100

K_POINTS automatic
6 6 6 1 1 1

CELL_PARAMETERS angstrom
   4.5886900051   0.0000000000  -0.0112230753
   0.0000000000   5.6083227763   0.0000000000
  -0.0600591093   0.0000000000   4.9344688436

HUBBARD {ortho-atomic}
U Mn-3d 4.65
U Co-3d 7.84
